<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">The transaction that you have submitted to the Navigator program for {!Opportunity.Legal_Name__c} has been declined. Details on reasons behind our decision will be sent shortly.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">The transaction has been transferred to Quick Bridge for a second review. &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">For further details about the transaction, please contact your Quick Bridge representative.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">The National Funding Team</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
